         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NCP302150 integrates a MOSFET driver, high-side MOSFET&#xD;&#xA;and low-side MOSFET into a single package.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
